{"sections":[{"slug":"意象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"意象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"意象"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为集合范畴的推广</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">意象</span> (topos) <span lang=\"zh\">是一种具有类似集合范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的性质的范畴</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">这些性质使得意象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">能够支持集合的许多操作</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">如构造两个集合</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无交并</span> $X + Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">乘积</span> $X\\times Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">映射的集合</span> $Y^X$ <span lang=\"zh\">等等</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">不过需要注意的是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">意象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">所支持的逻辑是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直觉主义逻辑","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直觉主义逻辑</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">而不一定是经典逻辑</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Boole意象","text":"Boole <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">其中排中律和选择公理可能不成立</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如拓扑空间上的层意象一般不是</span> Boole <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">原因来自于开集的补集不一定是开集</span>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">没有人能将我们驱逐出</span> Contor <span lang=\"zh\">为我们创造的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">集合论的</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">天堂</span>. —— David Hilbert (1926)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">而意象理论告诉我们</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在集合论的天堂之外还有无穷无尽的世界</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而集合的世界只是这片无穷无尽的森林中的第一棵树</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">作为几何对象</span></h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>L’objet de la Topologie est l’étude des topos (et non des seuls espaces topologiques).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑学的目标是研究意象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而不仅是拓扑空间</span>.</p>\n<p>—— Grothendieck, "},{"Local":{"url":"/SGA4","text":"SGA 4"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">关于译名</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>”</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/关于译名-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">关于译名</span>“<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>“"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3>Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/SGA4","text":"SGA 4"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">最早引入了</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span> (topos)” <span lang=\"zh\">这一概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">后来为了区分另一个稍有不同的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称之为</span> <strong>Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span></strong>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <strong>Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这一定义体现了意象作为几何对象的观念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">通常几何对象上具有</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">开集</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">覆盖</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">形成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的结构</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">那么这个景上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴可以视为该几何对象在意象理论中的化身</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象是某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正合局部化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正合局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">据</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/SGA4","text":"SGA 4"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">记载</span>, Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">的学生</span> Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">惊人地给出了</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象的纯范畴论刻画</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">后来称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Giraud公理","text":"Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">这一定义说明意象还具有一种独立于几何对象的观点</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">称范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> <strong>Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是说如下条件成立</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拉回","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/和(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">无交</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $X + Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的子对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">的交为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/始对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">始对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $0$);</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/满射(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">满射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">均为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有效满射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有效满射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">初等意象</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">逻辑学家从</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的视角出发考虑了</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">初等意象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>. Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象都是初等意象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但反之不然</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <strong><span lang=\"zh\">初等意象</span></strong> (elementary topos) <span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中存在有限极限</span>;</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积闭范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中存在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/子对象分类子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">子对象分类子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Omega$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">初等意象的概念与</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象最显著的区别在于去掉了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的条件</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如有限集的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是初等意象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而不是可表现范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">从而不可能是</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">不过</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一般人们还是讨论</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">所以在后文</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">以及</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯百科","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯百科</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的其它页面</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">中我们用</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">来代指</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">下降观点</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/CnossenHTT","text":"Cnossen"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">意象的范畴论性质还可以更加简洁地概括为余极限上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的性质</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为沿余极限的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/下降","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">下降</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">具体的定义如下</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <strong><span lang=\"zh\">意象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$: "},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>\n$$\r\n    \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Cat},\\, X\\mapsto\\mathcal C_{/X}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">保持极限</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的余极限</span> $X=\\operatorname{colim}_i X_i$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C_{/X} \\simeq \\operatorname{lim}_i \\mathcal C_{/X_i}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span> 1</strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">上述定义中俯范畴的极限有如下计算方式</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $X_\\bullet \\colon I\\to\\mathcal{C}$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_i \\mathcal{C}_{/X_i} \\simeq \\mathsf{Fun}^{\\mathrm{Cart}}(I,\\mathcal{C})_{/X_\\bullet},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathsf{Fun}^{\\mathrm{Cart}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是函子与</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">拉回变换</span>” (<span lang=\"zh\">自然性所需的方块均为拉回方块的自然变换</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">构成的范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span> 2</strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">可以具体写下两个方向的函子</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">在具有拉回和余极限的范畴中这两个函子构成一对伴随</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">左伴随部分为</span> $\\operatorname{colim} \\colon \\mathsf{Fun}^{\\mathrm{Cart}}(I,\\mathcal{C})_{/X_\\bullet}\\simeq \\operatorname{lim}_i \\mathcal C_{/X_i}\\to \\mathcal{C}_{/X}$,$$\r\n(Y_\\bullet\\to X_\\bullet)\\mapsto (\\operatorname{colim}_i Y_i \\to \\operatorname{colim}_i X_i).\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">右伴随部分</span> $\\mathcal{C}_{/X} \\to \\operatorname{lim}_i \\mathcal C_{/X_i}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是沿着每个</span> $X_i\\to X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"/基变换","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基变换</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们观察伴随的单位和余单位</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">单位</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对拉回变换</span> $Y_\\bullet \\to X_\\bullet$, <span lang=\"zh\">对每个</span> $j\\in I$, <span lang=\"zh\">单位给出同构</span>$$\r\n  Y_j \\to (\\operatorname{colim}_i Y_i)\\times_{\\operatorname{colim}_i X_i} X_j.\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">余单位</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $Y\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $Y_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其沿</span> $X_i\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拉回</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">余单位给出同构</span>$$\r\n    \\operatorname{colim}_i(Y_i) \\simeq Y.\r\n$$<span lang=\"zh\">换一种观点看待这个同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即沿</span> $Y\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拉回","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C_{/0} \\simeq *$;</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C_{/(X+Y)} \\simeq \\mathcal C_{/X} \\times \\mathcal C_{/Y}$. <span lang=\"zh\">这个性质又叫</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可扩展性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可扩展性</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>($\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴语境下</span>) $\\mathcal{C}_{/\\mathbf{B}G}\\simeq\\operatorname{lim}_{[n]\\in\\Delta}\\mathcal{C}_{/G^n}$. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群作用</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>($\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴语境下</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$, $\\mathcal{C}_{/\\operatorname{colim}_A *} \\simeq \\operatorname{lim}_A \\mathcal{C} \\simeq \\mathsf{Fun}(A,\\mathcal{C})$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">指数对象与幂对象</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">意象中的两个对象</span> $X,Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间可构造</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">指数对象</span></strong> $Y^X$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">赋值映射</span></strong> $\\operatorname{ev}\\colon Y^X\\times X \\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足伴随</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(Z,Y^X) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}(Z\\times X,Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的幂对象</span> $PX = \\Omega^X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是幂集的类比</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $\\operatorname{Sub}(X\\times Y)\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}(Y,PX)$, <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $PX$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\operatorname{Sub}(X\\times -)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示对象</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf {Set}^{\\mathbb N}$, “<span lang=\"zh\">随时间变化的集合</span>”;</p>\n<p>(??) <span lang=\"zh\">任何一个</span> Bool <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中的乘积是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">且</span>” $X\\wedge Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">指数</span> $Y^X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">蕴含</span>” $X\\Rightarrow Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">赋值映射是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">推理</span>” $(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\wedge X \\leq Y$;</p>\n<p>$\\mathsf {FinOrd}$, <span lang=\"zh\">有限基数的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中指数是通常的指数</span>;</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Sh}(X)$, “<span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">连续参数化的一族集合</span>”;</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf {Set}^{C^{\\mathrm{op}}}$, “<span lang=\"zh\">由小范畴</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">参数化的集合</span>”.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/位象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">位象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">又称</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}